   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>IKEA Foundation资助建造的&ldquo;Better Shelter&rdquo;难民之家是一个采用了平板包装设计理念的临时紧急庇护所，荣获了伦敦颇具声望的&ldquo;设计博物馆&rdquo;颁发的&ldquo;Beazley年度设计大奖&rdquo;。</strong></p>\n<p>因对百姓流离失所这一全球问题做出了杰出贡献，&ldquo;Better Shelter&rdquo;难民之家项目获得了建筑类冠军和所有类别的总冠军。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b8/cc/b8ccd2038ff70539ca199adfd24554f2.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
